=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 204% of normal in May to June, then fell to 28% in August to September. Grid 14573 had its driest year in 1954 at 53% of normal. For 2026 so far, the middle of the grids shows February to March at 43% and May to June at 193%.</p>"}
